Z||000035||DrRodey||12-14-2000||09:07 PM||||I've seen pics of them.. never in person, i'd like to though.  Body flex is a major problem with Convertable conversions.  It is covered in the instructions on building the kit, along with ways to strengthen the frame.  As long as you Reinforce the frame enough it doens't cause too much of a problem.  I"ll tell ya more in 5-10 years when the car has had it for a longer time.||||reg||1
