Z||000042||Spyder||12-16-2000||12:42 AM||||<BR>I bought the dash and door panels a few years ago from Specialty Car Interiors, Foster City California.  I don’t believe they are in business anymore, several people asked me about the interior so I tried to get in touch with them.  I had the guys home number but I misplaced it in my move(s).  You could probably contact FOCOA and ask them if they remember the guy because he had advertised pretty hard in the “never on time”” several months late” news letter.  <BR>This is a side note, if you know your news letter runs a quarter off, just redo the dates on the cover and make everyone happy. Sorry, had to vent.<P>Here is a finished version, mine will be all black.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interiorZX.jpg"> ||||reg||1
